    78	* At m=1,000,000 (n=6,000,002), 200 triangular trials: original fourth-coordinate error exceeding 1/2 occurred in **0/200**, pooled in **98/200**; the same-draw limiting configuration also predicts 98/200. Maximum LP residual was about **8.53e-14**. Smaller m had genuine large outliers: their full results are retained, including mean errors exceeding 1,000. They are not hidden or interpreted as contradicting the asymptotic proof.
